  "claim": "A particular race is an annual Monster Energy NASCAR Cup Series stock car race held at the Richmond Raceway in Richmond, Virginia, being the second of two races in the spring. The first one of this two races was sponsored from 2007 to 2011 by a brand that is owned by Diageo.  Virginia 529 College Savings 250 takes place the day before the race at the Richmond Raceway.",
